---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import Photo from '../../public/photo.jpg'
---

<section id="introduction" class="introduction">
  <div class="introduction-text">
    <p class="eyebrow">Backend engineer · Mexico City</p>
    <h1>Victorino<br /><span>Lavida.</span></h1>
    <p class="introduction-lead">
      Building reliable systems with Go, microservices, and cloud
      infrastructure.
    </p>
    <p class="introduction-detail">
      At Cicada, I rebuilt a bond-matching engine in Go, reducing order
      processing time from about one second to 200 milliseconds.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="#projects"
      >Explore my projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
    >
  </div>
  <div class="introduction-photo-container">
    <Image src={Photo} class="introduction-photo" alt="Victorino Lavida" />
    <p>Victorino Lavida <span>Mexico City, Mexico</span></p>
  </div>
</section>
